[{"id":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_fixer","label":"Fixer","value":"Text","prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"When a sensitive criminal enterprise goes wrong, it's time to call a fixer—the person who makes those problems go away. Sometimes doing so means the fixer gets their hands dirty with work no one else is willing or trained to do, such as cleaning a crime scene and hiding the evidence before it can come to light. At other times, being a fixer means being a master of data manipulation who can cover up a virtual trail, create a new identity, grease the right cogs in the bureaucratic machine, or contact other serious professionals, such as assassins, thieves, smugglers, and all manner of other specialists willing to do illegal jobs. Fixers also know how to smuggle goods and people, moving them before authorities can catch up with seizure orders or arrest warrants."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false}],"applies":{"All":[{"Compare":{"lhs":{"ClassLevel":"vanguard"},"op":"Gte","rhs":{"Const":1}}},{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_fixer"},"count":1}},{"Not":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_android_abolitionist"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_battleflower"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_espionage_specialist"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_fixer"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_free_trader"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_instructor"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"character_operations_manual:ability:vanguard_archetype_medic"},"count":1}},{"